38: /**
39:  * Due to Calcite will expand the whole SQL RelNode tree that contains query block, join hints will
40:  * be propagated from root to leaves in the whole RelNode tree. This shuttle is used to clear the
41:  * join hints that are propagated into the query block incorrectly.
42:  *
43:  * <p>See more at {@see org.apache.calcite.sql2rel.SqlToRelConverter#convertFrom()}.
